                <li><strong>09:45–12:00 PM:</strong> In-depth exploration of the tunnel complex and exhibits.</li>
                <li><strong>12:15–01:30 PM:</strong> Traditional Vietnamese lunch at a riverside restaurant near Cu Chi or back in suburban Saigon.</li>
