                <li><strong>Sit-Down Lunch:</strong> Most full-day private tours include a multi-course Vietnamese set lunch at a reputable local garden restaurant.</li>
                <li><strong>Downtown Admission Fees:</strong> Entry tickets to the Independence Palace (approx. 40,000–65,000 VND) and War Remnants Museum (40,000 VND). Note that official foreign admission to Cu Chi itself is <strong>135,000 VND</strong> (35,000 VND gate admission + 100,000 VND site guide/service fee).</li>
