                <li><strong>Small Group Minivan:</strong> A balanced middle ground (US$18–$35/pax) with 8–12 passengers and faster transit.</li>
                <li><strong>Independent DIY via Grab:</strong> Taking Grab to Cu Chi costs roughly 400,000–550,000 VND ($16–$22) each way. While hailing a Grab out from District 1 is easy, finding an app driver willing to accept a 50 km return trip back to Saigon in the early afternoon can be difficult and unpredictable. For urban budget touring, pairing a half-day trip with the <a href="/saigon-hop-on-hop-off-bus-guide" class="text-amber-800 hover:text-amber-900 font-semibold underline underline-offset-2 decoration-amber-300">Saigon hop-on hop-off bus</a> provides excellent city coverage.</li>
